<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#2E6B53">
    <title>Hors connexion — KIINI SAWA</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: #F8FAFC; color: #0F172A; font-family: -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; padding: 1.5rem; box-sizing: border-box; }
        .box { max-width: 26rem; text-align: center; }
        .logo { width: 64px; height: 64px; border-radius: 16px; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
        h1 { font-family: Georgia, serif; color: #2E6B53; font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0 0 .6rem; }
        p { color: #64748B; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
        button { background: #2E6B53; color: #fff; border: none; border-radius: 12px; padding: .8rem 1.4rem; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
        blockquote { font-family: Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; color: #1F4D3A; margin: 2rem 0 0; font-size: .95rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="box">
        <img src="/icons/icon-192.png" alt="" class="logo">
        <h1>Vous êtes hors connexion</h1>
        <p>KIINI SAWA a besoin d'internet pour afficher vos plans et enregistrer vos rituels. Vérifiez votre connexion, puis réessayez.</p>
        <button type="button" onclick="location.reload()">Réessayer</button>
        <blockquote>« Ceux qui se confient en l'Éternel renouvellent leur force. »<br>Ésaïe 40:31</blockquote>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
